{'symbol': 'MRO', 'date': '2019-10-29 22:30:00', 'title': 'MARATHON OIL CORPORATION DECLARES THIRD QUARTER 2019 DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 10, 2019', 'text': "MARATHON OIL CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF 5 CENTS PER SHARE ON COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 10, 2019, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 20, 2019."}